wash (0.10.0-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * clipboard: converge the wash + system clipboards behind HTTPS. Pastes
    (terminal right-click, editor menus) prefer navigator.clipboard.readText
    where readable and fall back to the wash clipboard; native pastes and
    input-field copies mirror into the wash clipboard; BE-originated
    clipboard changes mirror outward to the system clipboard.
  * term: right-click copies the selection / pastes when there is none
    (PuTTY semantics); Shift+right-click keeps the Copy/Paste menu.
  * fm: context menu gains Cut / Copy / Paste for files.
  * ui: context menus clamp into the viewport instead of rendering
    off-screen items near the bottom/right edges.
  * net/netd/edit/crash-pane copy buttons ride the shared clipboard helpers
    (visible to wash paste surfaces, working on plain-HTTP origins).
  * top: process rows are text-selectable for copying names/PIDs.

